{"step_index":198,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:33:49Z","content":"Two high-resolution speedrun flowcharts have been generated and saved directly to your workspace and Downloads folder:\n\n1. [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png) — Replicates and extends the visual style of [`GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg`](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg), completing the missing Chapter 1 narrative climax (*Missions 17–22*), detailing all micro-triggers, and integrating Any% routing skips.\n2. [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png) — A master campaign speedrun flow across all 5 chapters (102 missions), highlighting parallel downtime routing, cash gates, fast character swap milestones, weapon drops, and the optimal Any% ending.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Added & Improved Over `GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg`\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        KEY ADDITIONS & SPEEDRUN UPGRADES                               │\n├────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ The Missing Climax (Missions   │ Added: Recalibration -> Tourist Trap (Point of        │\n│ 17 - 22)                       │ No Return) -> Home Sweet Home -> Discharge Time        │\n│                                │ -> Port Gellhorn Hard Cut.                            │\n├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Parallel Downtime Route Split  │ Feng Shui imposes a 24-in-game-hour timer. Rather     │\n│ (Saves ~12 Minutes)            │ than sleeping, run Unwanted Attention -> Pipework     │\n│                                │ and Gear Up -> Just a Scratch during this timer.      │\n├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Mailbox Cash Accounting        │ Tracked all 4 cash drops ($140 + $200 + $600 + $600 = │\n│ ($1,540 Total)                 │ $1,540) to fund the mandatory BuckMe deposit.         │\n├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Any% Domestic Task Skips       │ Tagged Get Haircut, Buy Necklace, Buy Flowers,        │\n│ (Saves ~6 Minutes)             │ and Buy Groceries as pure skips (only feed bond meter)│\n├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Mandatory Story Gate Warnings  │ Just a Scratch cannot be bypassed; skipping causes    │\n│                                │ Joey's persistent calls to halt Day Release.          │\n└────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Any% Speedrunning Route Guide\n\n#### Chapter 1: The Keys (Missions 1–22)\n* **Prologue & Boat Drop**: Complete *Prologue* and *Gone Fishing*. Grab Donnie’s first mailbox check (**$140**).\n* **The 24h Timer Trick**: Start *Feng Shui*. When the 24-in-game-hour wait begins, **do not sleep**. Immediately complete the left branches:\n  * *Unwanted Attention* $\\rightarrow$ *Pipework* (collect Cal's **$200** mailbox).\n  * *Gear Up* $\\rightarrow$ *Just a Scratch* (complete vehicle repair before the timer ends).\n* **Skips**: Ignore *Get Haircut*, *Buy Necklace*, *Buy Flowers*, *Buy Groceries*, *Kenton Treasure Search*, and *Find Lost Drugs x4*.\n* **Point of No Return**: Starting *Tourist Trap* (Mission 19) permanently locks Chapter 1 free roam. Ensure all mailbox cash (**$1,540**) is deposited into BuckMe before accepting Mattia's pickup.\n* **Climax**: Defend the trailer in *Home Sweet Home*, complete *Discharge Time*, and trigger the hard transition to Port Gellhorn.\n\n#### Chapter 2: Port Gellhorn (Missions 23–44)\n* **Fencing Unlock**: Complete *Moses* (Mission 28) to register your getaway vehicle.\n* **Dual Character Switching Rush**: Beeline directly to *Coffee Break* (Mission 38). Completing this unlocks instant character switching across the map, allowing fast warps between mission markers.\n* **Skip**: Bypass secondary robberies (*Hit Kingpin Bowling*). Complete only *Hit Avery Pawn* (mandatory).\n\n#### Chapter 3: Vice City Heist (Missions 45–70)\n* **The Cartel Heist Preps**: Only two crew setup missions are strictly required:\n  * *Prep A: Nicole Park* (Safecracker).\n  * *Prep B: Company Property* (Heavy Vault Charges).\n* **Cell Tower Optimization**: In *Prep C: Hidden Charges*, detonate only **2 cell towers** rather than all 4. Two towers are sufficient to delay police dispatch without wasting travel time.\n* **Crucial Cash Rule**: Keep at least **$75,000** of your heist cut. **Do not spend it on vehicles or weapons.**\n\n#### Chapter 4: Airport Takedown (Missions 71–95)\n* **Instant Gate Clearance**: In *Party Hard* (Mission 75), Abe demands $75,000. Wire the preserved Chapter 3 cut instantly via BuckMe to eliminate money grinding.\n* **Weapon Drop**: During *VCIA Takedown* (Mission 93), pick up Francisco’s **LMG-6** from the tarmac. This weapon significantly accelerates combat against armored heavies in Chapter 5.\n* **Point of No Return**: Trigger *Sunset* (Mission 94) immediately.\n\n#### Chapter 5: The Finale & Any% Ending Decision (Missions 96–102)\n* **Ambush Trigger**: In *Protective Custody* (Mission 101), select **\"Proceed\"** immediately at Giorgio’s ambush. Never select \"Postpone\".\n* **Fastest Any% Ending Choice**:\n  * **Select Ending B: The Deal** (Accept Mendez’s Plea).\n  * *Why*: Ending A (*Bonnie & Clyde*) requires maintaining high bond stats and holding **$2,000,000 in Family Savings**, which adds 30+ minutes of grinding. Ending B skips the savings check entirely and triggers the fastest credits roll.\n\n---\n\n### Output File Locations\n\n* Complete Chapter 1 Flowchart:\n  * Workspace: [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png)\n  * Downloads: [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png)\n* Full 5-Chapter Campaign Master Speedrun Map:\n  * Workspace: [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png)\n  * Downloads: [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png)\n* Markdown Mission Database:\n  * [gta6_mission_flow_chart.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md)","thinking":"Files appear to be duplicated across two directory structures. The goal is to move the files into one designated location, resolving the redundancy. Now verifying that the files are the exact same by comparing checksums.\n\n\n"}
