{"step_index":214,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:34:43Z","thinking":"The mission flow chart specifies the ending \"Bonnie & Clyde\" requires a \"Hot Together\" status and $2 million. The build script also lists this ending, with similar but slightly more detailed requirements. The user's feedback suggests that the flowchart and the build script may contain inaccurate or incomplete information. Further investigation is needed to clarify the true requirements.\n\n\nThe initial playthrough data confirms the $2 million is not a prerequisite for the \"Bonnie & Clyde\" ending but rather the reward. The game flow seems to involve bouncing between storylines, suggesting a degree of linearity in the mission structure, with some paths becoming available based on progress in others. It's now understood that the $2 million is an earned outcome, not a requirement to unlock that specific ending.\n\n\nThe \"Bonnie & Clyde\" ending requires trust and positive choices between Jason and Lucia during key story moments, contradicting the prior assumption of a $2 million requirement. This ending awards the $2 million as a reward, not a prerequisite. The exact time difference between the \"Bonnie & Clyde\" ending (requiring the swamp shootout) and \"The Deal\" ending (immediately signing a state plea deal) remains to be assessed.\n\n\nThe game's mission structure seems to involve a cooldown system between strands, explaining why multiple mission markers can appear simultaneously. This suggests that completing a mission for one contact triggers a wait period before another contact's mission becomes available. Rapidly completing missions likely results in a back-and-forth between storylines, while allowing cooldowns to expire enables multiple strands to appear concurrently.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\gta6_mission_flow_chart.md","EndLine":165,"StartLine":115,"toolAction":"Viewing Chapter 3 in markdown","toolSummary":"View Chapter 3 in gta6_mission_flow_chart.md"}}]}
{"step_index":215,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:34:59Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T18:34:59-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T18:34:59-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`\nTotal Lines: 271\nTotal Bytes: 12198\nShowing lines 115 to 165\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n115: ```\n116: \n117: ---\n118: \n119: ## 4. Chapter 3: Tits, Ass, Drug Money (Vice City Infiltration)\n120: \n121: ### Mechanics & Structure\n122: - **Scope**: Largest chapter in the game (26 main missions).\n123: - **Key Factions**: Boobie Ike, Raul Bautista, Colombian Cartel (*La Polilla Negra*).\n124: - **Major Heist**: **The Sinfrontera National Bank Heist**. The heist involves a mandatory scoping phase followed by 5 modular preparation/intel missions that govern the vault timer, police response speed, and final crew survival.\n125: \n126: ```mermaid\n127: flowchart TD\n128:     C2_End[\"From Ch. 2: Checking Out\"] --> M45[\"45. Welcome to Vice City\"]\n129:     M45 --> M46[\"46. Dealer's Choice\"]\n130:     M46 --> M47[\"47. Meet the Heders\"]\n131:     M47 --> M48[\"48. Dubious Provenance\"]\n132:     M48 --> M49[\"49. Mami Knows Best\"]\n133:     M49 --> M50[\"50. South Leonida Real Estate\"]\n134:     \n135:     M50 --> M51[\"51. Tyrone\"]\n136:     M51 --> M52[\"52. Here, Kitty Kitty\"]\n137:     M52 --> M53[\"53. Car Service\"]\n138:     M53 --> M54[\"54. Top Billing\"]\n139:     M54 --> M55[\"55. Boobie Time\"]\n140:     M55 --> M56[\"56. First Impressions\"]\n141:     \n142:     M56 --> M57[\"57. Caught Slipping\"]\n143:     M57 --> M58[\"58. Crosstown Traffic\"]\n144:     M58 --> M59[\"59. Credit Check\"]\n145:     M59 --> M60[\"60. Steal the Zorrusso for Randy\"]\n146:     \n147:     subgraph Heist_Prep[\"Sinfrontera Bank Heist Pipeline\"]\n148:         M61[\"61. Sinfrontera National Bank<br/>(Heist Scope Out)\"]\n149:         \n150:         M61 --> P1[\"62. Security Expert<br/>(Retrieve Nicole Park)\"]\n151:         M61 --> P2[\"63. Company Property<br/>(Steal Vault Explosives)\"]\n152:         M61 --> P3[\"64. The Missing Link<br/>(Interrogate Monty)\"]\n153:         \n154:         P1 --> P4[\"65. Safe Word<br/>(Safe-Cracking Training)\"]\n155:         P2 --> P5[\"66. Hidden Charges<br/>(Rig 3 Cell Towers - Delays Police)\"]\n156:         \n157:         P3 --> P6[\"67. Ride or Die\"]\n158:         P4 --> P7[\"68. Cooties\"]\n159:         P5 --> P8[\"69. Bricked Up\"]\n160:         \n161:         P6 & P7 & P8 --> M70[\"70. The Cartel Heist<br/>(Sinfrontera Vault Score)\"]\n162:     end\n163: ```\n164: \n165: ---\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":216,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:34:59Z","thinking":"Investigating the mission flow chart reveals a sequence of events. The chart progresses from mission M50 to M56, then transitions to M57 and continues to M60. This sequence indicates a specific storyline progression within the game.\n\n\nThe original assumption of a linear mission progression seems incorrect based on observed player experiences and diagram discrepancies. Several distinct mission strands branch from the initial safehouse setup, including Tyrone's, Dre/Boobie's, and Raul/Randy's. Each strand has a set of linked missions and each appears to have cool-down timers, explaining why players perceive a bouncing between storylines. This suggests the branching structure should be represented differently, likely with parallel mission flows.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\gta6_mission_flow_chart.md","EndLine":271,"StartLine":220,"toolAction":"Viewing Chapter 5 and endings in markdown","toolSummary":"View Chapter 5 endings in gta6_mission_flow_chart.md"}}]}
{"step_index":217,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:35:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T18:35:11-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T18:35:11-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`\nTotal Lines: 271\nTotal Bytes: 12198\nShowing lines 220 to 271\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n220:   - **\"Postpone\"**: Exit and complete any remaining world exploration or bank $2,000,000 for savings thresholds.\n221:   - **\"Proceed\"**: Initiates a continuous ~60-minute non-stop combat and set-piece gauntlet culminating in *\"The End of the Road\"*.\n222: \n223: ```mermaid\n224: flowchart TD\n225:     C4_End[\"From Ch. 4: Starting From Zero\"] --> M96[\"96. Bird in the Hand\"]\n226:     M96 --> M97[\"97. Taking Liberties\"]\n227:     M97 --> M98[\"98. VC Baby\"]\n228:     M98 --> M99[\"99. Doggie Bag\"]\n229:     \n230:     M99 --> M100[\"100. Operation Savage Glory<br/>(Coast Guard Base Assault & Bridge Demolition)\"]\n231:     \n232:     M100 --> M101[\"101. Protective Custody<br/>(Giorgio's Betrayal & Precinct Ambush)\"]\n233:     \n234:     subgraph Endgame_Gauntlet[\"Final Lockdown Gauntlet\"]\n235:         M101 -->|\"Proceed Prompt\"| M102[\"102. The End of the Road<br/>(Penthouse Assault & Keys Escape)\"]\n236:     end\n237:     \n238:     subgraph Endings[\"Branching Resolutions\"]\n239:         M102 --> E1[\"Ending A: Bonnie & Clyde<br/>(Requires 'Hot Together' Status + $2M Banked)\"]\n240:         M102 --> E2[\"Ending B: The Deal<br/>(Accept Mendez's Immunity Plea)\"]\n241:         M102 --> E3[\"Ending C: The Sacrifice<br/>(Solo Extraction Fallback)\"]\n242:     end\n243: ```\n244: \n245: ---\n246: \n247: ## 7. Prerequisite & Unlock Reference Matrix\